	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04pc0101_girl4_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>サザナミわんの　かいていいせき……
かべに　きざまれた　メッセージ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-04T02:45:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-01T10:33:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>サザナミ湾の　海底遺跡……
壁に　刻まれた　メッセージ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-04T02:45:53" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-01T10:33:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・海底遺跡について
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-18T07:39:52" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GIRL4</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-02T08:11:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T13:33:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04pc0101_badman_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>うっている　モンスターボールも
どこかで　つくっている▽
ひとが　いるから　かえるんだよな▼
ありがとう！　どこかで　ボールを
つくっている　オレの　しらない　ひと！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-16T06:50:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-02T07:59:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>売っている　モンスターボールも
どこかで　作っている▽
人が　いるから　買えるんだよな▼
ありがとう！　どこかで　ボールを
作っている　オレの　知らない　人！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-16T09:54:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-02T07:58:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-18T07:39:53" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BADMAN</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-02T08:00:24" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T13:33:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04pc0101_mission_add_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>フフフ……　きみさ
なんの　へんてつもない▽
オボンのみを▽
１０００円と　いわれたら　かう？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-12T11:24:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
