				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-12T11:24:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>フフフ……　きみさ
なんの　変哲もない▽
オボンのみを▽
１０００円と　いわれたら　買う？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-12T11:24:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-12T11:24:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・フェス用システムフラグがOFF
・はい/いいえの選択肢
　はい　→mission_add_02
　いいえ→mission_add_03</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-12T11:24:03" />
		</CommentCell>
